// A control message in the direct chat while reading the tribe scrolled
// up: it is a quiet line, never a bubble, and never unread (v27), so the
// chat opens at its end with the line in view, not at "New messages".
// needs: peer
// check: open land=end
{"width": 1180}
{"select": "{{tribe}}"}
{"wait": 2}
{"scroll": 1500}
{"wait": 1}
{"signal": "peer-sends-control"}
{"wait": 5}
{"probe": "open", "for": 3}
{"select": "{{chat}}"}
{"wait": 2.5}
{"snapshot": "dm"}
